{
  "_synthetic": "Made up, shaped like the echo-call capture of 2026-10-20 (read locally from its sanitized reference copy; docs/protocol/calling-echo.md): text frames the web client sends on its Trouter sockets during the test call, each with what the browser fence's frame rule makes of it. Tokens, ids, correlation vectors and the endpoint names are made up.",
  "sockets": {
